# {{ project_title }} iOS app

Native SwiftUI client for iOS 17 and later, generated by the cliver-playbook
scaffold. The Xcode project is generated from `project.yml` with XcodeGen; the
`.xcodeproj` is intentionally not checked in. All code uses Apple frameworks
only: SwiftUI, Foundation, Security and Observation.

## Requirements

- Xcode 15 or later with an iOS 17 simulator or device.
- [XcodeGen](https://github.com/yonaskolb/XcodeGen) (`brew install xcodegen`).

## Generate and run

```sh
cd apps/ios
xcodegen generate
open {{ project_slug }}.xcodeproj
```

Build and test from the command line:

```sh
xcodebuild build -scheme {{ project_slug }} -destination 'generic/platform=iOS Simulator'
xcodebuild test -scheme {{ project_slug }} -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 15'
```

The Core package is independent of the app target, so its tests also run on a
Mac with Xcode installed:

```sh
swift test --package-path apps/ios/Packages/Core
```

